      "index": "a63",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "OWNERSHIP BOUNDARY\nPayload migrations own Payload schema. Application migrations own app tables. Supabase Auth owns auth.users.\nCross-domain content references use stable IDs; do not assume RLS protects tables accessed through Payload database credentials.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OWNERSHIP BOUNDARY\nPayload migrations own Payload schema. Application migrations own app tables. Supabase Auth owns auth.users.\nCross-domain content references use stable IDs; do not assume RLS protects tables accessed through Payload database credentials.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 21
    },
